Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When you walk through a storm\N♪ 当你穿过风暴时 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your head up high\N♪ 抬起你的头颅 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't be afraid of the dark\N♪ 不要害怕黑暗 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of a storm\N♪ 在风暴的尽头 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a golden sky\N♪ 有一片金色的天空 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sweet silver song of a lark\N♪ 还有云雀甜美的银歌声 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on through the wind\N♪ 在风中继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on through the rain\N♪ 在雨中继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Though your dreams be tossed and blown\N♪ 哪怕梦想被风雨打落吹散 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on\N♪ 继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on\N♪ 继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With hope in your heart \N♪ 心中怀有希望 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll never walk alone\N ♪ 你永远不会独行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never walk alone\N ♪ 你永远不会独行 ♪
